@OrderInventory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5270

### Get a page of products
GET {{OrderInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Product/GetAllProducts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Search products by name
GET {{OrderInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Product/GetAllProducts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchName=coffee
Accept: application/json

###
